=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Hopper''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Mad Redstone Engineer}} for {{Coins|50}}.

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Hoppers''' can be placed as a block and [[mcw:Hopper#Usage|used]] on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} to funnel items into containers, including other '''Hoppers''', {{Item|Chest}}s, [[Furniture]] storage, and other blocks. 

